# SBL_COMANDO structure

- Frontend (live app): `base44-app/` — **do not rename** (CodeBuild copies this path).
- Backend: `backend/` (FastAPI, Alembic, EB Docker, `buildspec.yml`).
- Infra: `terraform/`. CI triggers: `.github/workflows/`.
- `frontend/` is a legacy stub — do not add product code there.
- Place pages in `base44-app/src/pages/`, components in `base44-app/src/components/`, API routers in `backend/app/api/` or `backend/app/auth/`.
- Do not dump loose configs in the repo root; keep env templates next to the owning package.
- Durable media: `/api/media/{id}` + `media_assets` table (not EB ephemeral disk alone).
- Tab/brand icons: `base44-app/public/logo.png` (+ generated favicons), not text-only SVG.
